<title>USA: Eaton names David Chen as China head.</title>
<headline>Eaton names David Chen as China head.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eaton Corp said Wednesday it had appointed David Chen as its president for China.</p>
<p>Chen, who will be based in Shanghai, will assist the company's operating units in making a presence in China as well as identifying opportunities in the country, it said.</p>
<p>Before joining Eaton, Chen was chief representative in China for the BOC Group Plc, a British supplier of industrial and specialty gases, it said.</p>
<p>Eaton Corporation manufacturers truck transmissions, engine components and other products for the vehicle, industrial, construction, commercial and aerospace markets.</p>
</text>
